<title>UK: Cirqual says to raise 15.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Cirqual says to raise 15.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British aluminium company Ciqual Plc said on Friday it would make a placing and open offer of 6.44 million new shares at 248 pence each to raise about 15.4 million stg.</p>
<p>The company said the money would be used to repay borrowings made recently to finance two recent acquisitions.</p>
